      "message": "Merge main into issue/894-thread-mill (generate.rs, Tool literals, egui_app mod/pages, mill2d_c: keep both)\n\n- generate.rs: main hoisted geom/holder/cutter to the top of\n  run_job_arms; this branch's #894 root_cutter shadowing stays at its\n  original spot.\n- Tool literals: main's `turning` and this branch's `pitch_min` both kept;\n  thread_mill() and main's recorded_post_streams take the other's field.\n- egui_app mod/pages: thread-mill rows and main's turning rows both kept.\n- mill2d_c: this branch's thread_mill helper (Tap stand-in retired).\n- hole_wall_flats (main's #1205 test): moved onto the reworked Thread op\n  (multi-form thread mill, pitch None, right hand; kernel rows/hand/\n  external/through).\n- tool_icons (main's #661 exhaustive per-kind glyph law): original\n  tool-thread-mill and tool-thread-mill-single masters, rendered by\n  `cargo xtask icons`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
